 -158T130 -185T117 -194Q113 -194 104 -185T95 -172Q95 -168 106 -156T131 -126T157 -76T173 -3V9L172 8Q170 7 167 6T161 3T152 1T140 0Q113 0 96 17Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<g transform=\"translate(24,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-41\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-42\" x=\"750\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(0,533)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-AF\" x=\"-70\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(62.847019402138045,0) scale(3.915408529593832,1)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-AF\"></use>\n</g>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-AF\" x=\"1704\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(2003,0)\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAINB-2245\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(3342,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(24,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-43\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-44\" x=\"760\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(0,522)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-AF\" x=\"-70\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(47.637878127899796,0) scale(4.224890167897086,1)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-AF\"></use>\n</g>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-AF\" x=\"1816\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"4981\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>\nand we use special marks like in the diagram below.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div id=\"graphic-e2b5ac142d29526c27c21f99bbe9e1bc\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/e2b5ac142d29526c27c21f99bbe9e1bc\"></div>\n\n<p><br></p>\n<p>We can also write \n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://ww